[[File:EGY orthographic.svg|thumb|right|Egypt]]

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|en|Ægypt||archaic}}
* {{alt|en|Ægipt|Aegipt|Egipt|Egipte||obsolete}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|Egipt}}, from {{der|en|frm|Egypte}}, from {{der|en|la|Aegyptus}}, from {{der|en|grc|Αἴγυπτος}} (see also the {{cog|gmy|-}} ethnonym {{m|gmy|𐁁𐀓𐀠𐀴𐀍||Egyptian}}), from {{der|en|egy|ḥwt-kꜣ-ptḥ||Egypt; [[Memphis]]; the temple of [[Ptah]] in Memphis|lit=The temple of the {{l|en|ka}} of [[Ptah]]}}, whose Late Egyptian pronunciation is reflected by {{cog|akk|𒄭𒆪𒌒𒋫𒀪|tr=ḫikuptaḫ}}.

